<Legal title="Cancellation & Refunds" description="Cancellation and refund policy for Krylabs paid digital products and subscriptions.">

  <p>This policy applies to paid products, subscriptions and event reservations offered by Krylabs, owned and operated by Krithick Santhosh.</p>

  <h2>Subscriptions purchased via the App Store</h2>
  <p>Subscriptions and in-app purchases made through Apple's App Store are managed by Apple. Cancellations and refunds for those purchases are handled under Apple's terms, through your Apple account settings.</p>

  <h2>Invoiced payments</h2>
  <p>Payments to Krylabs are typically collected through invoices and payment links issued via
  RBI-authorised payment aggregators such as Razorpay. Cancellation terms for invoiced work are as
  agreed for that engagement or stated on the invoice. Duplicate or erroneous payments are refunded
  in full &mdash; email us with the payment reference.</p>

  <h2>Event reservations (BubbleNest)</h2>
  <p>Where seat reservations for BubbleNest social dining events are sold online, they may be
  cancelled up to <strong>24 hours before the event start time</strong> for a full refund.
  Cancellations within 24 hours of the event, and no-shows, are non-refundable, as seats are
  confirmed with the venue in advance. If we or the venue cancel or reschedule an event and you
  cannot attend, you receive a full refund automatically.</p>

  <h2>Other direct purchases</h2>
  <p>For other purchases made directly through Krylabs, you may request cancellation by contacting us. Approved refunds are processed to the original payment method within <strong>5–7 business days</strong>.</p>

  <h2>Refund timelines</h2>
  <p>All approved refunds, including event reservation refunds, are credited to the original payment method within <strong>5–7 business days</strong> of approval.</p>

  <h2>How to request</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:info.krylabs@gmail.com">info.krylabs@gmail.com</a> with your order details. We review each request and respond promptly.</p>
</Legal>
